Package: voov-meeting
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libnss3, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libglib2.0-0, libpulse0, libgcrypt20, libdbus-1-3, libsystemd0, libudev1, libasound2, desktop-file-utils
Recommends: xdg-utils, libnotify4
Maintainer: Homin Luo <homin.ro@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/hominluo/voov-meeting-linux
Description: VooV Meeting (unofficial Linux build)
 VooV Meeting is Tencent's international video-conferencing client.
 .
 Tencent only ships a Linux client for the China-only "Tencent Meeting"
 product, so this package repackages that build and patches its signaling
 endpoints to the international VooV infrastructure.
 .
 Release @RELEASE_NAME@ tracks VooV Meeting @APP_VERSION@; the bundled
 application tree is Tencent Meeting @UPSTREAM_VERSION@ for Linux.
 .
 This is an unofficial community build. The bundled binaries are proprietary
 Tencent software; only the packaging and patch scripts are MIT licensed.
